  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "1998 Chinese Spring Cruise of the Yellow Sea",
  "description": "Oceanography data from cruise covering the whole Yellow Sea. Cruises were carried out from the spring of 1996 to the spring of 1998. Data include chemical and biological observations, CTD, and ADCP. [ Reference: PICES Scientific Report No. 18 2001, Proceedings of the PICES/CoML/IPRC Workshop on \"Impact of Climate Variability on Observation and Prediction of Ecosystem and Biodiversity Changes in the North Pacific\", http://www.pices.int/publications/scientific_reports/Report18/default.aspx. ]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To better understand the Yellow Sea.",
